<title>USA: Great American Bancorp completes stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Great American Bancorp completes stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>CHAMPAIGN, Ill. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great American Bancorp Inc said Friday it completed its repurchase of five percent of its common stock, or 92,630 shares.</p>
<p>Great American said it had 1,852,606 common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company is the parent of First Federal Savings Bank of Champaign.</p>
<p>Its shares were off 1/4 Friday at 15-7/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
